guarantee: AC5: ioFailed{reason} is reason_of(kind), not a constant
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/storage.rs
added_by: test-writer
test: cargo test -j2 -p voicen-core --lib call::storage::tests::
--- old
            reason: Some(reason_of(kind)),
--- new
            reason: Some(reason_of(io::ErrorKind::Other)),
--- end
